                  "text": "Dan 12:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo uucita zitaluleme kaciya bucita mbubonya, oyo uuli amatombe kaciba simatombe, oyo uucita bululami kaciya bucita bululami, ayooyo uusalala kacisalala.",
